    <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 10px; background: #10b98122; color: #10b981; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 14px;">02</div>
    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">Uncrating &amp; Inspection:</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Workers use padded gloves and anti‑static mats. Boxes are opened in a clean, dust‑free zone. The first 30 minutes are dedicated to a visual inspection: no dents, broken seals, or missing parts. Any damage triggers a damage report and a replacement request.</p>
  </div>
  <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75); border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 14px; padding: 24px 20px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;">
    <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 10px; background: #3b82f622; color: #3b82f6; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 14px;">03</div>
    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">Electrical &amp; Mechanical Testing:</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">All power‑connected devices receive a quick voltage check with a multimeter. Motors, pumps, and HVAC units are run at low speed to confirm operation. Sensors and controls are calibrated against manufacturer specifications. Test results are entered into the digital logbook and signed off by the quality inspector.</p>
  </div>
  <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75); border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 14px; padding: 24px 20px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;">
    <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 10px; background: #a855f722; color: #a855f7; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 14px;">04</div>
    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">Furniture Placement:</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Clean, flat‑floor areas are marked with floor tape to designate optimal placement. Each piece is positioned to align with the client’s layout plan. Heavy items are lifted with forklifts and secured with tie‑downs. The team ensures that no furniture is placed on uneven surfaces or near heat sources.</p>
  </div>
  <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75); border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 14px; padding: 24px 20px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;">
    <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 10px; background: #ec489922; color: #ec4899; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 14px;">05</div>
    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">Debris Removal:</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">A dedicated crew collects all packing material—cardboard, bubble wrap, packing peanuts—in sealed bins. Bins are transported to a recycling station outside the delivery area. The floor is swept and vacuumed, leaving a spotless environment ready for final handover.</p>
  </div>
</div>

<p>Throughout the entire process, the team maintains a real‑time log of all actions, capturing photos and signatures. This documentation not only supports the client’s warranty claims but also serves as a compliance record for Chhatisgarh’s internal audit.</p>
<p>By adhering to this structured protocol, the company guarantees that every item is verified, tested, and installed to the highest standard, while keeping the delivery zone clean and debris‑free.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>



